---
description: bun:test for unit/integration, Playwright for E2E, MSW for HTTP stubs
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

Do not add Vitest or Jest.

- Unit/integration: `bun:test`, colocated `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx`. Use `mock()` from `bun:test`, not `vi.fn`.
- HTTP stubs: `@repo/mocks` (already started from `test/setup.ts`).
- E2E: `e2e/<app>`, files named `*.spec.ts`. Import `test` / `expect` from that app’s `playwright.setup`, not `@playwright/test`.
